  "body": "Part 1 of the #853 split. Sub-issue: #4255. Rebuilt from current `main`; 10 files.\n\n- Adds `crates/i18n`: dependency-free `Lang` descriptor, `REGISTRY`, catalogue reader, `tr()/tr_in()/count()`, BCP 47 locale parsing, coverage report and tests.\n- Adds `assets/i18n/zh-CN.toml` (3,638 strings) and the translator workflow (`assets/i18n/README.md`, `scripts/i18n/check.py`).\n- Adds `docs/I18N.md` and the decision record.\n- Adds the workspace member and dependency wiring in `Cargo.toml`.\n\n**No UI text is routed yet**; no font, picker or preference in this PR.\n\nVerification: `python3 scripts/i18n/check.py assets/i18n/zh-CN.toml` → 3,638 strings, 0 errors (25 notes about trailing whitespace already present in the source strings). `cargo test -p camcraft-i18n` to be run by CI (Rust 1.90 required).\n\nSupersedes the core slice of #3304.\n",
